  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "awesome-loop-engineering",
  "description": "\n  \n\n\nAwesome Loop Engineering Dataset\n\n\n  A structured dataset of 972 papers, official docs, tools, benchmarks, patterns, critiques, and implementation guides for recurring AI-agent systems.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  Resource Atlas \u00b7\n  GitHub field guide \u00b7\n  Resource selection \u00b7\n  Report a correction\n\n\n\n  \n  &nbsp;\n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nEach row connects an original source to its contribution, novelty, impact, publication details, lifecycle stages, audience, evidence type, link status, and\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/cy0307/awesome-loop-engineering.",
  "alternateName": [
    "cy0307/awesome-loop-engineering",
    "Awesome Loop Engineering"
  ],
